  "rationale": "Test whether waiting for truthful stance support prevents progressing a swing over missing support. Joint control continues during the wait. A hold can instead delay relocation, hit its safe timeout, or leave a swing unfinished within the unchanged horizon. Report actual holds, releases and progress together with original contact, relocation and terminal-support criteria. This is contact-aware scheduling, not whole-body force-aware recovery.",
